  Text: "\"Please! You gotta help! He took them! <link>Miss Marcelle</link> gave
    them to us and that jerk just took them!\" \n \n\"Nobody was supposed to see!\"\n
    \n\"His name is <link>Lars Boullie</link>\"  \n\"I don't know where he is but
    I heard he stole <link>Wheezie's new phone, he lives at 24 Nostra Street</link>.
    Maybe he knows something.\" \"His full name is Wilbur Brown.\" "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
